  backgroundNightPanel: {fileID: 234953963}
  backgroundNightImage: {fileID: -6414785134311008807, guid: 155b20041e369bf47af4ed591cf94ad8, type: 3}
  dialogueBoxPanel: {fileID: 1017733493}
  raspberryDialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 1801469808}
  playerDialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 1759374225}
  characterPanel: {fileID: 1063688658}
  characterIdleImage: {fileID: 459354229}
  characterHappyImage: {fileID: 1265209132}
  characterSadImage: {fileID: 277989062}
  characterAngryImage: {fileID: 641554953}
  characterFlirtyImage: {fileID: 2015549231}
  heart: 0
  maxHeart: 10
  slider: {fileID: 330502198}
  heartIncreaseReaction: {fileID: 1064710679}
  heartDecreaseReaction: {fileID: 461087922}
  GirlBGM: {fileID: 282497778}
  GirlGiggle: {fileID: 1422407351}
  GirlDisgust: {fileID: 484105273}
  GirlGasp: {fileID: 292070842}
  GirlSigh: {fileID: 395958833}
  GirlAngry: {fileID: 25982959}
  sentences:
  - 'Player: What the...? '
  - 'Oh bonjour! You must be the lucky person who wishes to eat me! '
  - 'Player: Why is my cupcake talking to me right now? '
  - "You thought you could just eat me without getting to know me first? Ch\xE9rie,
    It's just manners!"
  - "I didn't get your name, how rude of me! So ch\xE9rie, what is your name?"
  - Name...
  - 'Ooooo, you must be tourist. You don''t see that name a lot around here. '
  - 'I am Dame Framboje. Do you like? I came up with it myself. '
  - 'Merci beaucoup! You''re as sweet as meringue!  '
  - 'I guess names aren''t important when you''re hungry. '
  - 'Ah, you''re right! Dame Framboje? *She laughs nervously* What was I thinking? '
  - You picked me, you love cupcakes non? Tell me {Name} what's your favourite flavor?
    *She looks at you hopeful that you pick the RIGHT one*
  - "Strawberry? Oh no, ch\xE9rie. That's my relative. Serious bad blood."
  - Vanilla? A bit common, don't you think?
  - Je suis ravi! I knew you'd pick raspberry. I'm just so ravishing.
  - "So ch\xE9rie, what do you want to talk about?  "
  - 'Well as you can see {Name}, I''m an extravagant raspberry cupcake, with a lot
    of confidence and a big heart! '
  - 'It''s so horrid being on display all day, especially when you are next to Un
    idiot. '
  - '{Name}: An idiot? Who exactly is this idiot? '
  - "Oh ch\xE9rie, such bad manners bringing up my ex on a date."
  - He was all butter no brains, you know how croissants are, non?
  - You dodged some serious food poisoning by not picking him!
  - 'THAT PUTAIN STOLE MY CHOCOLAT PRINCE! MY OWN FAMILY BETRAYED ME IN THIS WAY! '
  - Oh sorry {Name}, forgot to use my inside voice. I just need to get away from
    all this drama.
  - '{Name}: Zut! Sounds bad, when did this all happen Dame?'
  - Yesterday...
  - '{Name}: Oh... well I see why you''re so passionate amor. '
  - 'Amor? (She blushes) Mmh, with one word you''ve brought me back to my senses. '
  - 'I like the sound of that, I''ll call you amor too from now on. (she winks at
    you) '
  - 'Nothing? You don''t wish to speak to me? Your date? '
  - 'If we aren''t speaking, how do you expect me to just let you EAT me!? '
  - '{Name}: No, no! I just couldn''t think of anything to say.'
  - 'I''m just hungry, you know? '
  - Hungry? Oh so now every hungry tourist that walks in here just gets to EAT me
    without even having a proper conversation?
  - "You poor thing, learn some manners ch\xE9rie, maybe then we can have some fun.
    *she shakes her head in disaproval*"
  - 'Oh {Name}, I can practically hear your stomach growling from here. *She laughs* '
  - 'You must really want me.  '
  - 'Tell me {Name}, why should I let you eat me? '
  - 'You promise to savour every bite? *She locks eyes with you, while moving closer.* '
  - '{Name}: I promise. '
  - Alright {Name}, I'm all yours.
  - 'Excuse me?? '
  - 'Well, you wouldn''t be the first. Spare your teeth, do not dare to eat me. '
